t;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important;\\\">上市公司（不包括金融保險業及大飲等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">36</span>家）申報財務報告時間於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">14</span>日截止，經證交所統計，上市公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">108</span>年上半年度總營業收入<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">13</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7,298</span>億元，較去年同期成長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">1,072</span>億元，增幅<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">0.79%</span>，更創下十年新高紀錄；<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">108</span>年上半年度總稅前淨利<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">8,463</span>億元，較去年同期衰退<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2,465</span>億元，減幅<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">22.56%</span>，亦為近十年第四高。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">證交所表示，本國上市公司（不包括金融保險業及大飲等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">36</span>家）及第一上市公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">108</span>年上半年度財務報告分別計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">822</span>家及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">74</span>家，已於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">108</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">8</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">14</span>日完成公告申報。本國上市公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">108</span>年上半年度營業收入<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">13</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">3,462</span>億元、創十年新高，較去年同期成長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">631</span>億元，增幅<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">0.48%</span>；<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">108</span>年上半年度稅前淨利<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">8,137</span>億元，較去年同期衰退<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2,521</span>億元，減幅<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">23.65%</span>，亦為近十年第四高。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">獲利成長產業主要為航運業、水泥工業及其他業。航運業因運價、運量皆成長而推升獲利；水泥工業因特定地區需求及價格皆大幅成長而增加獲利；其他業則受惠東京奧運及全球運動風氣日盛，價量齊昂，使獲利表現佳。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">獲利衰退產業主要為半導體業、塑膠工業及油電燃氣業，衰退主因係中美貿易戰及全球景氣趨緩，塑膠工業及油電燃氣業另因油價走勢不利而影響獲利。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-colo